      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Cloning is an antiquated mechanic predating avatar search worlds and indexes like VRCNext DB, avtrDB, and so on. Anyone can grab the avatar ID from [output logs](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/9521522810899-Where-do-I-find-my-Output-Logs-and-Crash-Dumps), or from the debug UI logs view. If the avatar is public, then it can be switched into from the website.\n\nIf you don't want your avatar to be copied, do not set it to Public status. Once it's Public, *anyone* can use it. (Many \"lock\" systems can also be defeated easily with OSC or by editing a JSON file in LocalAvatarData.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
