  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "You know when you have to go to your settings just to turn on ur avatar for someone and someone you dont want steals it? Just add a feature when you click on someone there will be a \"Send Avatar\" button and I that players notifications they just have to click Accept and they will Clone the Avatar, so no more having to go into your settings just to turn ur cloning on when you can just send the Avatar to the player!",
